WEBVTT

00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:06.480
Next, who wants to be on
the Beautification Committee?

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:09.580
Me!

00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:10.980
I'll do it!

00:01:41.870 --> 00:01:46.910
Kobayakawa-san texted me saying she was
thinking of joining the Beautification Committee.

00:01:46.910 --> 00:01:48.850
Oh, you exchanged numbers.

00:01:48.850 --> 00:01:49.310
Yeah.

00:01:49.310 --> 00:01:51.330
Huh, things are really moving for you two.

00:01:51.330 --> 00:01:52.790
I know, right?

00:01:52.790 --> 00:01:55.400
And she even said she liked
being together with me, too!

00:01:55.400 --> 00:01:57.260
You've said that 100 times now.

00:01:57.260 --> 00:01:59.710
And? Anything since then?

00:01:59.710 --> 00:02:00.840
No, just that.

00:02:00.840 --> 00:02:02.230
How come?!

00:02:02.230 --> 00:02:04.240
She said it, so go for it!

00:02:04.240 --> 00:02:07.010
Well, Na-chan's not that type.

00:02:07.010 --> 00:02:09.910
So, you have the committee
before you head home today?

00:02:09.910 --> 00:02:10.560
Yeah.

00:02:10.560 --> 00:02:12.020
How about you two?

00:02:12.020 --> 00:02:14.360
I have plans with a girl.

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:15.690
Me too, with Yukirin.

00:02:16.120 --> 00:02:19.110
What? That leaves me with nothing to do!

00:02:19.110 --> 00:02:21.130
Don't you have someone, Kei-chan?

00:02:21.130 --> 00:02:22.550
You made that chocolate.

00:02:22.550 --> 00:02:23.660
Oh, that?

00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:25.780
I gave it to my ex-girlfriend.

00:02:25.780 --> 00:02:26.590
Your ex?

00:02:26.590 --> 00:02:29.290
She's 25 and used to be a private tutor.

00:02:29.290 --> 00:02:31.540
So mature!

00:02:32.070 --> 00:02:34.690
While we started out as teacher and student,

00:02:34.690 --> 00:02:39.720
it was delightful how we
gradually reversed roles...

00:02:40.470 --> 00:02:44.090
We're close enough now to talk
about old times like that.

00:02:44.090 --> 00:02:46.790
I see... that's incredible...

00:02:46.790 --> 00:02:50.070
It's a shame I don't have
feelings for her anymore...

00:02:50.070 --> 00:02:52.650
I've got nothing going on, and it's boring.

00:02:52.970 --> 00:02:54.000
Kei-chan...

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:55.110
Not to mention...

00:02:55.110 --> 00:02:59.490
I've got some new techniques,
but nobody to use them on.

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:00.780
Oh? Show me.

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:04.780
I've worked out how to put someone
in a turtle-shell binding with one swing!

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:06.490
Whoa, that's awesome!

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:08.830
Go for it.

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:10.210
Hey, wait!

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:13.090
Sorry about this.

00:03:13.090 --> 00:03:15.380
Kei-chan's got an evil grin!

00:03:18.670 --> 00:03:19.920
I'll head back now!

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:21.550
You won't get away!

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:27.430
Ouch!

00:03:27.430 --> 00:03:30.020
Whoa, that was sudden.

00:03:30.900 --> 00:03:32.890
Hashiba and... a rope?

00:03:33.180 --> 00:03:34.730
Oh, Taizou!

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:36.210
Sorry for bumping into you.

00:03:36.210 --> 00:03:37.820
Nah, it's fine.

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:38.860
Is Keiichi here?

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:39.820
He is, but...

00:03:40.390 --> 00:03:43.740
Taizou, mind letting go of that?

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:45.170
Oh, my bad.

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:47.460
Do you need something?

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:48.780
Well, today...

00:03:48.780 --> 00:03:51.790
The basketball team's seniors
and manager aren't around.

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:53.870
I thought you might like to join us for a game.

00:03:54.640 --> 00:03:55.630
Basketball?

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:58.040
Yup, red vs. white team match.

00:03:58.040 --> 00:04:00.460
Sure! I'm in!

00:04:02.070 --> 00:04:02.800
Later.

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:05.430
Na-chan, see you later.

00:04:05.840 --> 00:04:07.050
Hashiba-kun.

00:04:08.300 --> 00:04:09.600
Are you heading to the committee?

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:12.020
Y-Yeah!

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:16.020
Anna! I'm coming, too!

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:16.960
Huh?

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:18.770
You can't. You're not on the committee.

00:04:19.340 --> 00:04:22.360
But if guys like him are there...!

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:24.980
Oh, Hashiba-kun, we should get going.

00:04:24.980 --> 00:04:27.200
Uh, right.

00:04:27.610 --> 00:04:29.820
Okay, Mari-chan, we're heading off now.

00:04:29.820 --> 00:04:32.120
Wh-What...

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:34.770
What is so great about that little monkey?!

00:04:34.770 --> 00:04:36.680
Anna, you dummy!

00:04:38.520 --> 00:04:39.730
Little monkey?

00:04:40.640 --> 00:04:41.210
Me?

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:43.650
Anna, you're dumb...

00:04:43.650 --> 00:04:44.880
...but so cute.

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:46.550
Hey, Spitting Woman.

00:04:47.060 --> 00:04:49.280
Don't talk to me. It's creepy.

00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:51.520
You've been avoiding me ever since that time.

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:52.700
Well, what did you expect?

00:04:52.700 --> 00:04:54.010
You molester! Pervert!

00:04:54.010 --> 00:04:55.270
You give me the creeps!

00:04:55.270 --> 00:04:57.410
Now, don't be rude.

00:04:57.410 --> 00:04:58.870
I'm just stating the facts!

00:04:58.870 --> 00:05:01.030
You're the creepiest creep in the universe!

00:05:01.030 --> 00:05:03.440
Just be grateful I don't
sue you into the ground.

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:08.110
I'll kiss you again.

00:05:08.110 --> 00:05:10.190
Make a move and you'll regret it!

00:05:12.960 --> 00:05:15.870
You're not cute at all.

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:19.270
It's not like I care what you think about me.

00:05:21.240 --> 00:05:21.800
Fine.

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:24.920
I think you are cute.

00:05:26.110 --> 00:05:26.840
Huh?!

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:32.210
You creep! Die!

00:05:37.210 --> 00:05:39.310
Tsuyoponnu!

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:42.820
You could have waited at the station.

00:05:42.820 --> 00:05:45.190
I couldn't stand waiting, so I came!

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:46.180
Sergeant!

00:05:46.180 --> 00:05:49.140
I brought them all! Every episode of Gannyomu!

00:05:49.140 --> 00:05:50.150
Well done.

00:05:50.150 --> 00:05:51.370
Allow me to carry it.

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:54.290
Then, may I request that we hold hands?

00:05:54.940 --> 00:05:55.730
Permission granted.

00:05:55.730 --> 00:05:56.960
Yay!

00:05:57.520 --> 00:06:00.830
Let's watch it at your place.

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:02.050
We're done.

00:06:02.050 --> 00:06:03.000
Good work.

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:05.750
Good work, everyone.

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:09.810
Kobayakawa-san.

00:06:09.810 --> 00:06:10.610
Yes?

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:13.340
Um...

00:06:13.340 --> 00:06:14.470
Er...

00:06:15.720 --> 00:06:18.080
Thank you for your hard work on the committee.

00:06:18.080 --> 00:06:19.310
And you, as well.

00:06:19.310 --> 00:06:21.010
Um, Kobayakawa-san.

00:06:21.010 --> 00:06:21.400
Yes?

00:06:21.890 --> 00:06:23.570
Would you like to walk home together?

00:06:24.200 --> 00:06:25.210
Together?

00:06:25.210 --> 00:06:26.110
Yes.

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:30.170
And, if you don't mind,
we could stop somewhere...

00:06:30.170 --> 00:06:30.780
Um...

00:06:31.420 --> 00:06:33.090
If you're hungry...

00:06:33.090 --> 00:06:36.910
I won't insist if you're not, though.

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:37.580
A parfait.

00:06:37.900 --> 00:06:38.620
Huh?

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:44.000
Oh, it doesn't have to be a parfait, but
I was thinking I'd like something sweet.

00:06:44.320 --> 00:06:46.380
Do you like sweets?

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:48.130
Of...

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:49.050
Of course!

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:50.810
I love...!

00:06:52.740 --> 00:06:53.960
...sweets.

00:06:53.960 --> 00:06:56.050
I see. That's good.

00:06:56.050 --> 00:06:59.210
Well, I'll go get my bag.
Meet me by the entrance hall.

00:06:59.210 --> 00:06:59.770
Okay.

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:05.900
I did it!

00:07:07.420 --> 00:07:08.570
Oh, Na-chan.

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:10.190
Is the committee done?

00:07:10.190 --> 00:07:11.200
Yeah.

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:12.960
I'm waiting for Kobayakawa-san.

00:07:12.960 --> 00:07:14.990
We're heading off to eat some sweets.

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:16.890
Wow, awesome!

00:07:16.890 --> 00:07:17.890
That's a date!

00:07:17.890 --> 00:07:18.660
I know, right?!

00:07:18.970 --> 00:07:21.010
I know a great place.

00:07:21.010 --> 00:07:22.490
It'll be perfect!

00:07:22.490 --> 00:07:23.330
Yeah.

00:07:23.990 --> 00:07:25.950
Hashiba-kun, sorry for the wait.

00:07:25.950 --> 00:07:27.000
Ah, right!

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:28.550
Shall we go, then?

00:07:28.930 --> 00:07:30.150
Later, Kei-chan.

00:07:30.150 --> 00:07:31.760
Bye bye.

00:07:38.440 --> 00:07:40.850
Um, Katakura-kun!

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:44.520
I'm Furuta from Class 6.

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:46.690
During the athletics festival last year.

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:49.400
I thought you were cool.

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:51.950
Ever since then, I've had my eyes on you...

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:53.360
I love you.

00:07:53.360 --> 00:07:54.750
Please, go out with me!

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:58.580
You can't?

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:01.790
No, it's not that, just...

00:08:02.290 --> 00:08:04.540
Do you enjoy pain?

00:08:05.860 --> 00:08:06.960
Pain?

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:10.050
I'm into bullying my girlfriends.

00:08:10.050 --> 00:08:12.590
I like using a whip and other toys.

00:08:12.970 --> 00:08:15.810
Of course, you'd have to be
completely submissive.

00:08:15.810 --> 00:08:19.360
I'm into bon**** and using can**** too.
Can you handle that?

00:08:20.320 --> 00:08:21.800
N-No, I can't do that!

00:08:21.800 --> 00:08:23.480
I take back my confession!

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:28.400
I thought you were a nice, big-hearted guy.

00:08:28.740 --> 00:08:30.940
I had no idea you were that weird.

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:32.440
Honestly, it's really off-putting.

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:33.920
Excuse me.

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:39.330
That's what happens when you confess
to people you don't really know.

00:08:43.770 --> 00:08:45.210
Welcome back.

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:46.670
Was that a confession?

00:08:47.030 --> 00:08:49.690
Yeah, but she took it back.

00:08:49.690 --> 00:08:50.990
How'd that happen?

00:08:50.990 --> 00:08:54.100
Apparently my tastes are hard to accommodate.

00:08:54.100 --> 00:08:54.880
Could be.

00:08:55.700 --> 00:08:57.520
How do I say this...

00:08:57.520 --> 00:08:59.370
When I look at the other three,

00:08:59.370 --> 00:09:01.840
they're all in love and
seem to be enjoying it.

00:09:02.840 --> 00:09:05.930
And, while I do think
I'd like to have a girlfriend,

00:09:05.930 --> 00:09:08.650
I can't go out with someone
just to see how it goes.

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:13.570
And, when I told her about myself,
she said I was weird and off-putting.

00:09:14.470 --> 00:09:17.990
Maybe romance just isn't meant for me.

00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:20.870
So that's why you joined us
for basketball today.

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:25.920
You come here whenever
something is bothering you.

00:09:25.920 --> 00:09:28.000
You work out your frustrations
through exercise.

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:30.260
I just wanted to play basketball, that's all.

00:09:30.260 --> 00:09:31.500
Really?

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:33.450
When we entered this school,

00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:37.240
you always came here complaining you didn't
know anyone in your class, remember?

00:09:37.240 --> 00:09:38.850
Oh, did I?

00:09:38.850 --> 00:09:39.410
Yeah.

00:09:39.410 --> 00:09:41.030
But once you met people you got along with,

00:09:41.030 --> 00:09:43.170
you stopped coming around as much.

00:09:54.570 --> 00:09:55.460
Morning.

00:09:55.460 --> 00:09:57.450
Kei-chaaan!

00:09:58.730 --> 00:09:59.920
Kei-chan! Kai-chan!

00:09:59.920 --> 00:10:02.500
Kei-chaaaaaaaaan!

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:03.240
What?

00:10:03.240 --> 00:10:04.870
Good morning.

00:10:04.870 --> 00:10:07.100
I attacked you and raised my voice,
but you're not angry!

00:10:07.100 --> 00:10:07.750
I knew it!

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:10.780
It's okay to bring out your whip.

00:10:10.780 --> 00:10:12.250
Be yourself, Kei-chan!

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:13.900
Uh, okay...

00:10:13.900 --> 00:10:14.960
Keiichi.

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:18.080
I don't know if she'll be your type,

00:10:18.080 --> 00:10:21.390
but I texted you the address
of a girl who's tough-skinned.

00:10:21.390 --> 00:10:22.960
Thanks...

00:10:22.960 --> 00:10:24.510
But why?

00:10:25.170 --> 00:10:26.220
Tsuyopon?

00:10:26.960 --> 00:10:29.850
I've given you the Naoe Family's
special green pepper steak.

00:10:29.850 --> 00:10:31.650
Oh, thank you.

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:34.690
Wait, why?!

00:10:35.270 --> 00:10:36.800
What's gotten into all of you?

00:10:36.800 --> 00:10:37.740
It's strange!

00:10:39.430 --> 00:10:42.200
We got a text from Taizou yesterday.

00:10:42.200 --> 00:10:44.600
He said that you'd turned "M".

00:10:44.600 --> 00:10:46.440
And that you're afraid of girls now.

00:10:46.440 --> 00:10:48.250
And that you have no appetite.

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:51.670
How did Taizou interpret what I told him?

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:53.860
Oh... was he wrong?

00:10:53.860 --> 00:10:56.090
Uh, yeah, he's wrong.

00:10:56.390 --> 00:10:58.770
Thank goodness! I was so worried!

00:10:58.770 --> 00:11:01.130
It was like Taizou was sending out an SOS.

00:11:01.130 --> 00:11:03.930
That guy needs to stop
sending misleading texts.

00:11:03.930 --> 00:11:05.650
Were you guys...

00:11:05.650 --> 00:11:07.220
...worried about me?

00:11:07.220 --> 00:11:08.970
Well, of course!

00:11:08.970 --> 00:11:10.600
We thought something must've happened.

00:11:10.950 --> 00:11:12.980
You never tell us anything.

00:11:12.980 --> 00:11:17.650
I thought your personality may have
changed due to excessive stress.

00:11:17.650 --> 00:11:19.730
You're not Kei-chan if you're not "S".

00:11:19.730 --> 00:11:20.820
Yup!

00:11:21.550 --> 00:11:23.980
To be honest, I was feeling a bit frustrated.

00:11:23.980 --> 00:11:25.990
Oh! You okay?

00:11:26.260 --> 00:11:27.810
I'm alright now!
